This folder is a snapshot of the ColdBox BoxLang application template, kept so that a BxAgents build can
lay out an app exactly the way ColdBox's own template does, without the network.

  Source:   https://github.com/coldbox-templates/boxlang
  Pinned:   see VERSION (version, tag if any, exact commit)
  Licence:  Apache License 2.0 (the upstream readme carries the Apache 2 badge). Upstream does not ship a
            LICENSE file in this checkout, so LICENSE here is the Apache 2.0 text this repository uses.
  Copyright 2005-2007 ColdBox Framework by Luis Majano and Ortus Solutions, Corp (www.ortussolutions.com)

Only the files the running app needs are vendored: public/*, app/Application.bx and runtime/boxlang.json.
The only change to an upstream file is one line of runtime/boxlang.json: "whitespaceCompressionEnabled"
is false (see VERSION and AGENTS.md). Refresh with tools/refresh-coldbox-template.sh, which shows the diff.
